// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (same folder) and put the real key in the copy.
//
//   cp native/Config/Secrets.example.xcconfig native/Config/Secrets.xcconfig
//
// Secrets.xcconfig is gitignored. NEVER commit it, and never put a key in this example file.
//
// Use a restricted key from a dedicated OpenAI project for Budgie, allowed only the
// two models voice entry uses, with a monthly budget and hard limit set on the project
// (docs/FULL_APP_PLAN.md section 6). The key ships inside the app bundle, so anyone
// with the IPA can extract it; those limits cap what a leaked key can cost.
//
// xcconfig treats "//" as the start of a comment. OpenAI keys never contain "//",
// so paste the key as-is, unquoted.
//
// Release builds fail while the value is empty or still the placeholder below.
OPENAI_API_KEY = REPLACE_WITH_OPENAI_API_KEY
